Add ticket-aware task execution to Visual Studio Code.

Add a "Run Task..." action to individual ticket context menus. The ticket does not need to be open
in an editor. Selecting the action must retain the selected ticket, show available Visual Studio
Code tasks, and run the chosen task through the Visual Studio Code task API.

Expose the selected ticket filename and directory as separate command variables for use in
`tasks.json`:

```text
${command:ticketfile.selectedTicketFileName}
${command:ticketfile.selectedTicketDirectory}
```

The directory variable must identify the configured ticket directory that owns the selected
ticket. The filename variable must contain the ticket filename without its directory. Values must
come from the selected tree item and must not depend on the active editor.

Keep task definitions and command behavior in Visual Studio Code configuration. Worktree removal,
branch deletion, ticket closure, and other task-specific operations are outside this work item.

Development Checklist:

